WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.770
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.610
<i>I need to let Yume-chan know soon.</i>

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.330
What's the matter, Nijino?

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.460
My throat doesn't feel right for some reason.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.590
Let me see.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:30.630
Open wider.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:35.590
I'm not seeing any inflammation.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:41.270
Well, with how you blew everyone away with your last performance, I'm not surprised it took a toll on you. {especially Rola re: blown away}{you had a dangling or misplaced or whatever it hight}{I actually knew but couldn't fix it}

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:43.520
Give your throat some rest.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:44.980
Okay.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:50.980
<i>Now that I think about it...</i>

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:58.030
<i>My voice always seems to get messed up after I go all out on stage.</i>

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.410
All right, one more time.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:01.620
<i>I wonder if I'm straining myself without realizing.</i>

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.330
Okay, that's enough.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.710
I need to train my core more.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:07.290
This time, focus on really projecting directly out.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:10.040
Direct your gaze a bit more upwards.

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:15.130
Rola, wanna grab lunch with me?

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:19.140
Sorry, I'd planned to practice 
on my own during the break.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:20.300
Oh, well.

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:21.930
Yume.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:26.980
I'll need to be a lot more serious if I want to be your true rival.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:29.560
I was thinking we should Aikatsu separately for a while.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:37.610
Don't worry. We'll still be best friends, same as ever.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:39.950
I just want to put some pressure on myself.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.490
Sure, I understand.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:47.120
Yume-chan!

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:50.250
Let's go have lunch.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.590
Sure!

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:56.130
Time to eat!

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:03.350
This tastes great! I was starving after all those sit-ups.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.480
Listen, Yume-chan.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.860
I'm going to be moving overseas.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:21.240
U-Um, huh?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:27.210
My dad's assignment is going to take a while, so we decided to move together as a family.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:29.620
I'm going to leave for Italy next week.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.840
Sorry it took so long for me to tell you.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:39.050
I had really wanted to tell you sooner.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:43.010
But then... are you going to give up Aikatsu?

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:49.270
Not at all. I'm planning on continuing my Aikatsu at my new school.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.900
Yume-chan, that's why—

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:55.650
Don't cry, Yume-chan. I won't cry either.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.610
We have our Aikatsu.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:02.910
Even if we're far apart, I'll believe we can still do our best together.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.990
I want to say goodbye with a smile.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.330
Y-Yeah.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:15.290
Got it. I'll work hard so that 
I can see you off with a smile.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.300
Thanks, Yume-chan.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.770
I heard about Koharu.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:01.360
Next week is just way too sudden.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.570
Yeah.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.240
Are you all right, Yume?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.360
Oh, right!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.580
I decided not to get sad until after.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:13.330
So anyway, there's something I'd like your help with.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:18.040
I want to throw a surprise farewell party for Koharu-chan.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.420
That gets me going.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:23.090
I'm not particularly inclined to lend you my assistance,

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.720
but if you insist, I suppose I wouldn't mind—

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:26.680
Ako says she's in.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.590
Hey, who let you decide for me?!

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.970
So you're not?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.930
I-I'll do it.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:35.520
Koharu deserves nothing less than my full effort.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.350
Thanks, everyone!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:55.410
Nijino-san.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:00.330
We heard about Nanakura-san's farewell party.

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.460
Do you mind if we help too?

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:08.430
Nanakura-san's always been really nice to us, so we wanted to give her something in return.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.680
Thanks. Let's make this a fun party.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:12.970
Sure.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.600
You must be feeling lonely already, Nijino-san.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:19.190
Nanakura-san talks about you all the time.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:21.360
Huh? She talks about me?

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:26.490
That's right. She's always saying how amazing you are,
 and how proud she is to be your oldest friend.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.450
She's your number one supporter.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.950
Koharu-chan...

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.790
I messed up...

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.580
Do your best, Yume-chan!

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.340
Don't lose, Yume-chan!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.630
Four Star Academy's way too selective for me.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.930
I know you can do it, Yume-chan.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:55.720
She's cheered me on every step of the way, ever since we met.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:07:00.390
Koharu's said that your performances kept her going too.

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.730
Oh, I've got it!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:06.570
How about you sing on stage for Koharu to cap the party off?

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.440
Huh, you think I should?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.860
Good idea. I think that would make her the happiest.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.240
All right, I'll do it.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:18.250
This is to show Koharu-chan how grateful I am for everything she's done for me.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:22.120
I'll give her my best performance ever!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:34.890
Koharu-chan.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.890
Are you finished packing?

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:37.970
Yeah.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.520
Your flight's tonight, right?

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:43.190
Yeah, my parents are coming 
to pick me up in the evening.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.160
So you're free until then.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.910
Come with me for a bit.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.250
Over here.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:04.750
All right, take off the blindfold.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:13.050
Surprise!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:21.770
We set up a surprise party for you since you're leaving on a journey.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.560
A lot of people came together to see you off.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:28.820
Even the headmaster and teachers have come.{can we make her subtly british posh instead of the other way}{as if I know how}

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.320
I'm so glad!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:33.990
Even though it won't be for long, 
we want you to have fun.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.160
Thank you.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:40.950
We'll begin with a slide show of the highlights of Koharu's time at Four Star Academy!{this isn't really a slide show, but sure}

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.960
Please enjoy!

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:01.430
This is delicious!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:05.480
The girls of S4 have arrived!

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.980
Thank goodness we made it!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:10.820
We all rushed over during the downtime between jobs.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:16.490
Yozora's still stuck at a shoot, but she said she'd make it back before you depart.{my lect best lect, etc.}

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:21.990
Even S4 is here... I'm sorry you had to take precious time out of your day for me.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.080
We made this as a present for you.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:28.580
Wow, it has all of S4's autographs!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:32.340
This is wonderful. I'll keep it as a Nanakura heirloom.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:36.470
Koharu-chan, we have a present for you too.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.800
They're adorable!

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.680
The resemblence is uncanny, isn't it?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.230
They're not great, but we did our best to make them.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:48.310
Perhaps yours, but I consider mine to be great.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:51.730
And Ako did the most work on the Koharu doll too. {pretty sure she means the Koharu one specifically}{yes}

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.860
We didn't want you to get lonely.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.740
Thank you.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:04.750
For the grand finale, her closest friend Nijino Yume will put all her gratitude into a farewell performance!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:14.800
<i>I want to put on the best show I can for Koharu-chan.</i>

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.920
<i>The very best I can!</i>

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:22.810
<i>I made this with Koharu-chan's favorite color, 
thinking about how she'll be turning over a new leaf.</i>

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:28.270
<i>My throat isn't totally recovered, but if I just try my hardest,</i>

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:31.360
<i>I know I'll be able to perform better than ever.</i>

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.440
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.450
Yume-chan!

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:25.450
Yume!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.450
<i>Koharu-chan...</i>

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:30.620
Yume-chan!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.990
Yume-chan!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.330
Yume-chan!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:37.080
Yume-chan! Yume-chan!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:37.830
Yume!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:38.580
Yume!

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:39.590
Yume-chan!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.010
<i>Nijino.</i>

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.850
Yume-chan...

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.860
Koharu... it's time.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.360
Everyone, thank you for all you've done.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.280
Take care, Koharu.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:09.780
Be sure to write us.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:12.120
I'm quite jealous you're going to Italy.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.370
Stick to your Aikatsu while you're abroad.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.450
I will.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:20.380
I hope Yume-chan is all right.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.800
I'm sure she just tried too hard.

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:27.170
She was really excited about wanting to put on a good show for you.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.300
I see.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:32.760
Knowing Yume, she's certain to be woken up by the sound of her growling stomach.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:37.020
Yeah. Please look after her.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:39.390
Hey!

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:40.650
Koharu-chan!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.520
I'm so glad we made it.

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:45.150
Yozora-senpai! Asahi-senpai!

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.530
We got held up at work.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:51.030
This is for you. Consider it from all your fans.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:53.530
I'll be waiting for you to come back.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.620
Take good care of your skin.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.080
Yozora-senpai...

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:01.290
It's so sad saying goodbye.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:04.840
You smell nice.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.300
That's right.

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:09.510
This is the same scented body mist as the one I use. {not perfume}

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:16.430
When you use this, imagine that the scent is me standing by your side.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.930
Okay. Thank you so much.

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:20.810
It's about time.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:21.770
Right.

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:23.440
Koharu, take care of yourself.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.570
I wish you healthy and happy Aikatsu.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:26.940
Be well.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:32.200
Thank you, everyone. 
Have a wonderful Aikatsu.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:56.680
Koharu-chan! Koharu-chan!

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:00.890
Koharu-chan!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.190
Take care!

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:11.190
Thank you, everyone!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:15.370
Thank you, Four Star Academy.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.210
Yume-chan...

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.380
<i>That's right, I was on stage...</i>

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:35.840
Koharu-chan!

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:42.730
Hold on, Nijino-san. You shouldn't get up so suddenly.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.860
Yume-chan, are you all right?

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:53.070
I need to get to Koharu-chan...

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.700
Wait, Nijino-san!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:55.240
Yume-chan!

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.740
Don't push yourself.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:00.120
I need to... say goodbye to Koharu-chan.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.250
Yume-chan.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:06.330
Koharu-chan already left.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:12.380
She wouldn't leave your bedside up until the moment she had to go.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.550
She was very concerned for you.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:21.140
No... I just wanted Koharu-chan to be happy...

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.310
I wanted to see her off properly...

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.110
Yume-chan, I have something important to tell you.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:33.650
Here.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.780
This will help your throat. Drink up.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.870
Why did I...

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:47.170
Yume-chan, do you remember the last time we were in here together?

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:51.800
Ever since then, I knew I would have to tell eventually.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.130
Yume-chan, are you aware of it?

00:17:56.130 --> 00:18:00.890
That sometimes your performances are so amazing it's almost like you're another person.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:01.890
Yes.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:07.480
You probably don't know, but I actually had the same experience in my first year.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:11.400
Fate has dealt us the same hand.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.690
I can't say whether it's a blessing or a curse—

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.990
It's almost as if the Aikatsu System chose us.

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:23.620
At first, I was overjoyed that I could put on shows better than I expected.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.290
But as I kept doing it over and over,

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:31.790
I started losing my voice after every performance.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:37.050
Over time, I became more and more afraid of taking the stage.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.720
Don't back down, Shiratori.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.970
Surpass the person you are today.

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:46.680
You have the talent.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.810
Improve yourself and overcome it.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:55.190
Consider this a trial from the God of the Stage. {almost theater no megami}

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.950
After that, I trained like my life depended on it.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:07.790
So that no circumstance could sway me, and I could perform to the best of my ability with skill alone.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:12.500
I apologize if I scared you.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:15.630
But it's important you knew.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:20.760
Um... I'm sorry, Hime-senpai.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:24.510
I... don't really understand.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:28.390
Right now, I can't think of anything but Koharu-chan.

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.440
I'm sorry.

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:33.310
That's fine, Yume-chan.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.110
<i>Don't lose.</i>

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.390
It's from Koharu-chan.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:14.270
<i>Yume-chan, it's almost time for me to go.</i>

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:18.150
<i>We didn't get to talk at the end, so I'm leaving you this letter.</i>

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.940
<i>Thanks for everything.</i>

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.950
<i>We've had a lot of fun together, haven't we?</i>

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:27.700
<i>We looked up to idols and became fans of S4.</i>

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:32.580
<i>I can still hardly believe that we made it into Four Star Academy.</i>

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.960
<i>Every day seemed to sparkle,</i>

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.290
<i>almost as if we were in a dream.</i>

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:43.510
<i>It's thanks to you that I resolved myself to move to Italy.</i>

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:50.220
<i>Every time I saw one of your spectacular performances, I got a heartfelt desire to improve myself.</i>

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:55.940
<i>I feel like I can't accomplish that without some kind of change.</i>

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.610
<i>We're still on our way to the future. {from mirai transit}</i>

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:03.110
<i>I'm off to find a new me in a new place.</i>

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:07.620
<i>This is the start line of my new Aikatsu.</i>

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:35.020
<i>I'll be your fan forever, Yume-chan!{"I'll be your fan forever, Yume-chan!"}</i>

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:39.150
Koharu-chan...

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:48.780
<i>I'm so sorry I couldn't give you a proper farewell, Koharu-chan.</i>

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:54.250
<i>I don't ever want to show you a failure like that again.</i>

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:55.290
<i>Not ever!</i>

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:12.470
<i>Still, can I really do my best without Koharu-chan?</i>

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:15.560
<i>I know you can do it, Yume-chan.</i>

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:20.060
<i>This is my new start line too.</i>

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:24.480
<i>My dream is to join S4!</i>

00:24:10.590 --> 00:24:11.760
Koharu-chan...

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:13.840
Tick tick tick tick... ding-dong!

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:17.680
Yume, you need to participate in the Fall Fest!

00:24:17.680 --> 00:24:19.390
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:21.770
Take Flight, Sky Girl! {didn't actually check the punctuation but whatever}{if cultural context wasn't the way it is, I'd make this Take Flight, Sky Girl!}{just do it}

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:24.100
Become the first-star idol!
